    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1274">

                <pb facs="0879" n="763" xml:id="pg763"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 312.115/15.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Consul Alger to the Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Extract.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Consulate</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Mazatlan</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1913-10-06">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">October 6, 1913</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Buelna has demanded eight thousand dollars from Rosario Mining Company as a loan.
                    They will have to pay or close down which means flooding of mine and a loss of
                    half a million dollars.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Alger</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
